- [#&#8203;16468](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16468) [`4cff3a1`](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/commit/4cff3a107c3750ab5f0878a6b41836705282b771) Thanks [@&#8203;matthewp](https://redirect.github.com/matthewp)! - Fixes the static preview server to respect `preserveBuildClientDir`, serving files from `build.client` instead of `outDir` when the adapter requires it

- [#&#8203;16770](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16770) [`1e2aa11`](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/commit/1e2aa11caf8e7a48f37dd614fd2d4c15cc7a8439) Thanks [@&#8203;matthewp](https://redirect.github.com/matthewp)! - Fixes a race condition where the Vite dep optimizer could lose React dependencies in dev mode when using Astro Actions

- [#&#8203;16468](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16468) [`4cff3a1`](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/commit/4cff3a107c3750ab5f0878a6b41836705282b771) Thanks [@&#8203;matthewp](https://redirect.github.com/matthewp)! - Exempts internal routes (e.g. server islands) from `getStaticPaths()` validation, fixing server island rendering on static sites

- [#&#8203;16468](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16468) [`4cff3a1`](https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/commit/4cff3a107c3750ab5f0878a6b41836705282b771) Thanks [@&#8203;matthewp](https://redirect.github.com/matthewp)! - Fixes preview for static sites that contain non-prerendered routes. Previously, the preview command ignored SSR routes discovered during route scanning and always used the static preview server.

